#: index.php:111
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Versioni"

#: index.php:144 index.php:286
msgid "Create bootable USB drives the easy way"
msgstr "Krijo nje bootable USB ne menyren me te lehte"

#: index.php:230
msgid "Change language:"
msgstr "Ndrysho gjuhën:"

#: index.php:239
msgid "Want to improve this translation?"
msgstr "Deshiron ta permiresosh perkthimin?"

#: index.php:313
msgid ""
"Rufus is a utility that helps format and create bootable USB flash drives, "
"such as USB keys/pendrives, memory sticks, etc."
msgstr ""
"Rufus eshte nje aplikacion i cili te ndihmon ne formatim dhe krijimin e nje "
"USB bootable, te tilla si USB keys/pendrives, karte memorie etj."

#: index.php:314
msgid "It can be especially useful for cases where:"
msgstr "Mund te ju ndihmoje vecanerisht ne raste kur:"

#: index.php:316
msgid ""
"you need to create USB installation media from bootable ISOs (Windows, "
"Linux, UEFI, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"ju duhet të krijoni media USB të instalimit nga ISO bootable (Windows, "
"Linux, UEFI, etj)"

#: index.php:317
msgid "you need to work on a system that doesn't have an OS installed"
msgstr "ju duhet te punoni ne nje sistem qe nuk ka instaluar nje OS"

#: index.php:318
msgid "you need to flash a BIOS or other firmware from DOS"
msgstr "keni nevoje per nje flash, BIOS ose firmware te tjera nga DOS"

#: index.php:319
msgid "you want to run a low-level utility"
msgstr "deshironi te perdorni nje sherbim te ulet"

#: index.php:321
msgid "Despite its small size, Rufus provides everything you need!"
msgstr ""
"Pavaresisht nga madhesia e vogel, Rufus ofron gjithqka qe keni nevoje!"

#: index.php:322
msgid ""
"A non exhaustive list of Rufus supported ISOs is also provided at the bottom"
" of this page."
msgstr ""
"Nje liste jo shteruese e Rufus mbeshtetur ne ISO eshte dhene gjithashtu ne "
"fund te kesaj faqeje."

